  "pilgrimage.need_arch_title":  { en: "The pilgrimage is shaped around the kind of mind you turned out to be.", zh: "这趟朝圣，是围绕你最终成为的那种心智而塑造的。" },
  "pilgrimage.need_arch_body":   { en: "Take the quiz first — five minutes, no signup. Once you have an archetype, this page will offer you a 30-day arc tuned to it.", zh: "先做测验吧——五分钟，无需注册。一旦你有了原型，本页就会为你呈上一条为它调校的 30 天弧线。" },
