  "inst.subtitle": { en: "Three taps and Mull lives on your phone like a native app — full-screen, no URL bar, with a tile that pulls up **Daily Spar**, **Pilgrimage**, or **The Inheritor** straight from your home screen. No App Store. No download.", zh: "三次轻点，Mull 就像原生应用一样住进你的手机——全屏、没有地址栏，主屏上的图标可直接打开 **Daily Spar**、**Pilgrimage** 或 **The Inheritor**。无需 App Store，无需下载。" },
