  "srch2.original_blurb": { en: "Public writing — diary entries, dilemma responses, and exercise reflections — voicing moves the philosophical canon doesn't strongly capture. The judgement is conservative; most entries are echoes, and only the ones that aren't land here.", zh: "公开的书写——日记、困境作答与练习反思——道出了哲学经典未能充分涵盖的思路。这里的判断很审慎；多数记录只是回声，只有真正例外的才会出现在此。" },
