  "llr.card_eyebrow": { en: "THE LONG LETTER · BUILDING", zh: "长信 · 建设中" },
  "llr.card_title": { en: "The slowest retention feature on Mull", zh: "Mull 上最慢的留存功能" },
  "llr.pitch": { en: "Once a year (or once per major life event), Mull invites you to write a long letter — 2,000+ words — about something specifically hard. Mull provides scaffolding (an outline tuned to your archetype) and saves it to a vault only you can read. Five years later, Mull surfaces the letter for re-reading. The five-year resurfacing IS the loop.", zh: "每年一次（或在每个人生重大节点），Mull 会邀请你写一封长信——2000 字以上——写一件格外艰难的事。Mull 提供框架（一份贴合你原型的提纲），并存入只有你能读的保险库。五年之后，Mull 会把这封信重新呈现给你重读。这五年后的重现，正是它的循环所在。" },
  "llr.doing_1": { en: "Once-yearly invitation, on a date you choose, with an archetype-tuned outline.", zh: "每年一次的邀请，日期由你选定，附上贴合原型的提纲。" },
  "llr.doing_2": { en: "Long-form composition surface (no rich text — just plain serif, focused).", zh: "长文写作界面（没有富文本——只有朴素的衬线字体，让你专注）。" },
  "llr.doing_3": { en: "Vaulted: only you can read it. Not backed up to research even if you've opted in.", zh: "存入保险库：只有你能读到。即便你已同意，也不会被备份用于研究。" },
  "llr.doing_4": { en: "Five years later, Mull surfaces it: 'You wrote this. Here is who you were.' The most permanent dopamine loop on Mull.", zh: "五年之后，Mull 会重新呈现它：「这是你写的。这就是当年的你。」这是 Mull 上最持久的多巴胺循环。" },
  "llr.when": { en: "Building now. Lowest priority because the payoff is 5 years out — but the most distinctive retention idea on the roadmap. Earliest ship: Q4 2026.", zh: "正在建设中。优先级最低，因为回报要等五年——但它是路线图上最独特的留存构想。最早上线：2026 年第四季度。" },
  "llr.meantime": { en: "The Diary is the daily-ish version. Start writing — the rhythm is the practice.", zh: "「日记」是近乎每日的版本。开始写吧——节奏本身就是修行。" },
  "llr.back": { en: "← Back to Mull", zh: "← 返回 Mull" },
  // Letters (coming soon) (ltr.)
  "ltr.header_eyebrow": { en: "▶ LETTERS BETWEEN INHERITORS · BUILDING", zh: "▶ 继承者之间的通信 · 建设中" },
  "ltr.header_title": { en: "A CORRESPONDENCE WITH THE DECEASED", zh: "与逝者的一场通信" },
  "ltr.card_eyebrow": { en: "LETTERS BETWEEN INHERITORS · BUILDING", zh: "继承者之间的通信 · 建设中" },
  "ltr.card_title": { en: "The Inheritor mystery, continued", zh: "继承者谜案，未完待续" },
  "ltr.pitch": { en: "If you finished the Inheritor, you got an archetype-keyed task from the deceased — visit the daughter, take the steamship ticket, publish the rival's letter. This surface extends the mystery: structured letters arrive in your inbox at +1 week, +1 month, +3 months, asking what you've done with the task. You write back. The deceased writes back to you.", zh: "如果你完成了「继承者」，便会从逝者那里得到一项与你原型相关的任务——去探望那位女儿、收下那张轮船船票、公开对手的信件。这个页面延续了这桩谜案：结构化的信件会在 +1 周、+1 个月、+3 个月时寄到你的收件箱，问你这项任务进展如何。你回信。逝者也回信给你。" },
  "ltr.doing_1": { en: "Opt-in after you finish the Inheritor. Mull schedules the first letter for +7 days.", zh: "在你完成「继承者」后选择加入。Mull 会把第一封信安排在 +7 天寄出。" },
  "ltr.doing_2": { en: "Each letter is in-fiction (the deceased writing) and personal (refers to your specific task and ending).", zh: "每封信都在故事之内（由逝者执笔），又是私人的（提及你具体的任务与结局）。" },
  "ltr.doing_3": { en: "Your replies persist as a private correspondence — readable only by you.", zh: "你的回信会作为一段私人通信留存——只有你能读到。" },
  "ltr.doing_4": { en: "Drops into /atlas as Depth + Self-Awareness XP.", zh: "成果计入 /atlas，记为深度 + 自我觉察经验值。" },
  "ltr.when": { en: "Building now. Needs Resend cron + persistent conversation state. Earliest ship: Q3 2026.", zh: "正在建设中。需要 Resend 定时任务与持久的对话状态。最早上线：2026 年第三季度。" },
  "ltr.meantime": { en: "Take or re-take the Inheritor murder mystery.", zh: "去玩或重玩「继承者」谋杀谜案。" },
  "ltr.back": { en: "← Back to Mull", zh: "← 返回 Mull" },
